msgid "On the search page, open the <b>Comments</b> tab to search what people wrote in comments (a guild's own search has it too). Words, \"phrases\" and <code>-words</code> are looked for in the comment's text. These operators work on comments: <code>%(from_op)s</code>, <code>%(in_op)s</code> (where the comment is: its post's guild, topic or curation), <code>%(since)s</code>, <code>%(until)s</code>, <code>%(after)s</code>, <code>%(before)s</code>, <code>%(on)s</code>, <code>%(min_votes)s</code>, <code>%(is_ai)s</code> and <code>%(is_partnership)s</code>. The ones about a post's own content (<code>%(has)s</code>, <code>%(lang)s</code>, <code>%(domain)s</code>, <code>%(url)s</code>, <code>%(flair)s</code>, <code>%(is_forward)s</code>, <code>%(min_comments)s</code>) are left out with a note."
msgstr "Pe pagina de căutare, deschide <b>Observații</b> tab pentru a căuta ceea ce oamenii au scris în comentarii (căutarea unei bresle o are prea). Cuvinte, \"fraze\" și <code>-words</code> sunt căutate în textul comentariului. Acești operatori lucrează la observații: <code>%(from_op)s</code>, <code>%(in_op)s</code> (în cazul în care comentariul este: bresa postului său, topic sau furaje curatate); <code>%(since)s</code>, <code>%(until)s</code>, <code>%(after)s</code>, <code>%(before)s</code>, <code>%(on)s</code>, <code>%(min_votes)s</code>, <code>%(is_ai)s</code> şi <code>%(is_partnership)s</code>Cele despre conţinutul unui post (<code>%(has)s</code>, <code>%(lang)s</code>, <code>%(domain)s</code>, <code>%(url)s</code>, <code>%(flair)s</code>, <code>%(is_forward)s</code>, <code>%(min_comments)s</code>) sunt lăsate pe dinafară cu un bilet."

